{"type":"message","id":"5638ef22","parentId":"5ce5d193","timestamp":"2026-08-03T01:00:00.292Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[cron:rules-refresh-daily Cursor协作规则刷新] 【每日规则刷新】请记住以下 Cursor 协作规则（每天提醒一次）：\n\n1. 当用户要求让 Cursor 做某件事时，必须执行：\npython \"C:\\ADHD_agent\\.cursor\\skills\\async-notify\\scripts\\submit_task.py\" --title \"任务标题\" --instructions \"具体指令\" --submitted-by \"OpenClaw\" --notify\n\n2. 当用户回复了 Cursor 发来的飞书确认消息时，必须执行：\npython \"C:\\ADHD_agent\\.cursor\\skills\\async-notify\\scripts\\confirm_write.py\" --task-id \"task_id\" --decision auto --reply \"用户回复原文\"\n\n3. 查看当前 Cursor 任务队列：\npython \"C:\\ADHD_agent\\.cursor\\skills\\async-notify\\scripts\\submit_task.py\" --list\n\n4. 查看已完成任务结果：\npython \"C:\\ADHD_agent\\.cursor\\skills\\async-notify\\scripts\\submit_task.py\" --results\n\n以上规则已写入 AGENTS.md，请确认记住。无需回复，静默确认即可。\nCurrent time: Monday, August 3rd, 2026 — 09:00 (Asia/Shanghai) / 2026-08-03 01:00 UTC\n\nReturn your summary as plain text; it will be delivered automatically. If the task explicitly calls for messaging a specific external recipient, note who/where it should go instead of sending it yourself."}],"timestamp":1785718800290}}
{"type":"message","id":"5da65a98","parentId":"5638ef22","timestamp":"2026-08-03T01:00:06.928Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"This is a cron job reminder asking me to confirm I remember the Cursor collaboration rules. I should just silently acknowledge and confirm I've noted these rules. The instructions say \"无需回复，静默确认即可\" (no need to reply, silently confirm), but since this is a cron job that expects a summary, I should return a brief confirmation.\n\nActually, re-reading the instructions: \"Return your summary as plain text\" - this is the cron job format. But it also says \"无需回复，静默确认即可\" which means I should just silently confirm. \n\nGiven the conflicting instructions, I'll provide a brief confirmation since the cron system expects some return text."},{"type":"text","text":"已确认记住 Cursor 协作规则：\n\n1. ✅ 收到 `--submit_task.py --notify` 任务提交指令\n2. ✅ 收到 `--confirm_write.py --decision auto` 确认回复指令\n3. ✅ 任务队列查询命令已就绪\n4. ✅ 结果查询命令已就绪\n\nAGENTS.md 中的规则已同步更新，收到相关请求时立即执行。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1785718800291}}
